 andha (breath holds and internal locks). Known to increase neuroplasticity
 \, nitric oxide\, and erase old mental and emotional patterns. Traditional
 ly\, pranayama is the doorway to access higher states of consciousness.\n\
 nThroughout the ongoing class different practices will be presented. Learn
  Cleansing kriyas\, Himalayan Pranayama including including Ujjayi Variati
 ons\, Heating & Cooling Breaths\, Solar\, Lunar & Soli-Lunar Nadi Shuddhi 
